description:
Implement a 4-bit Gray code converter. The module takes a 4-bit binary input D and produces a corresponding 4-bit Gray code output G, where each bit of G is calculated based on the exclusive OR of specific bits from D to ensure that only one bit changes between consecutive values, thus minimizing errors in digital communication systems.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] D,
    output reg [3:0] G
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [3:0] D,
    output reg [3:0] G
);always @ (D) begin
    G[3] = D[3];
    G[2] = D[3] ^ D[2];
    G[1] = D[2] ^ D[1];
    G[0] = D[1] ^ D[0];
