Design a 16-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of the 16 input signals based on a 4-bit selection input. The output will reflect the value from the selected input line, ensuring that when the select lines correspond to a specific input, that input's value is passed to the output. If the selection does not match any defined cases, the output defaults to LOW.
module top_module(
